          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "pien mannono gin ame en wum kede eno keken, boŋo ame wumo kome, en bino buto kara i gin aŋo? Ka ce dano moro bino kok baŋa, an abino winyo koko mere, pien an gira akica.",
          "type": "text",
